  "findings": [
    "Arial LRM/RLM have real zero-advance cmap outlines and paint in the measured lone/Latin/separated/Arabic contexts.",
    "Arial ZWJ/ZWNJ paint when the entire DrawString text is the lone joiner; the measured embedded Latin/separated/Arabic cases stay hidden.",
    "Other measured controls did not change paint under DisplayFormatControl; do not synthesize generic boxes or control-picture text.",
    "Native recorded control replay matches direct paint for all32 cases.",
    "Native National/Traditional Thai/Arabic/Persian digit records match literal ASCII controls exactly in both plain and Arabic RTL contexts; all18 native direct/replay pairs match.",
    "Native StringFormat language storage contains nonzero high words with neutral low LANGID0. Rejecting the full UInt32 value is incompatible.",
    "The handwritten Helvetica font object had DataSize42 with padded payload44; changing only DataSize to44 repairs Windows Aborted9 for all eight fixed-size files."
  ],
